WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.280
My favorite activity in Haiti

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:05.060
was simply walking the streets
and meeting the people.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:07.250
Hey, this is Jean Luc, he
lives here in Port-au-Prince.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:08.830
He says he watches me--

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:09.730
Every night.
Every single night,

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:11.290
that's so fantastic.

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:12.123
You say that you--
Hi, May-el.

00:00:12.123 --> 00:00:15.370
You think you can do the
string dance, is that it?

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:17.080
Mm, mm, mm.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.040
Yeah, and then what?

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.248
Hey, hey, hey, hey,

00:00:20.248 --> 00:00:22.300
hey, hey, hey, hey.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.510
What's up, you do it all the time

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:25.104
on national TV.
Oh, yeah yeah, right.

00:00:25.104 --> 00:00:26.700
(laughing) I forgot about that.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.230
Hey, everybody, this is Shnayder,

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:29.360
you're from Port-au-Prince.
Yes.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:30.750
And, I gotta say,

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.850
you've got some great style goin' on here.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:35.120
I like the glasses, I like the belt.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:37.740
You got it all goin' on.
Yeah, I'm a model so...

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:40.020
Do you think I could be a male model?

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:43.289
You should go to the
gym before. (laughing)

00:00:43.289 --> 00:00:45.270
What the hell?

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:47.937
You should go to the gym before.

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:52.111
Excuse me, excuse me, is it okay if I try?

00:00:52.111 --> 00:00:54.528
Could I try that?
Yes, try it.

00:01:01.686 --> 00:01:03.554
Is it good, good?

00:01:03.554 --> 00:01:04.387
Huh?

00:01:06.312 --> 00:01:08.849
(yelling)

00:01:08.849 --> 00:01:11.112
Oh, she's holding it.

00:01:11.112 --> 00:01:11.945
I got it!

00:01:12.948 --> 00:01:14.546
Viva Haiti!

00:01:14.546 --> 00:01:15.430
(cheering)
President Trump

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:17.610
insulted Haiti, so I
thought it was only fair

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:21.443
to give Haitians a chance
to return the favor.

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:18.370
This is Philemon; Philemon, you live here

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:20.010
in Port-au-Prince, right?
Yes, I do.

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:21.850
Okay, now you know that
this the famous hat

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:24.225
that Trump wears, Make
America Great Again?

00:02:24.225 --> 00:02:26.960
Yeah.
(laughing)

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:28.880
We thought we'd give you this hat.

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:31.953
Haiti Is Great Already, you like that?

00:02:31.953 --> 00:02:34.087
All right, put that on.

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:39.087
Here we go.

00:03:17.976 --> 00:03:20.809
Very good, very good, very good.

00:03:21.815 --> 00:03:22.648
Sir.

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:24.987
Sir, sir.

00:03:26.795 --> 00:03:28.378
If I could just--

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:41.250
Yes, yes, very good, oh my God!

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:42.930
I just missed my flight home.

